    <briefdescription>
<para>Common parsing and field extraction for client-style create/update payloads. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Parses a raw JSON body, records parse errors through error/success, and keeps both the parsed JSON and a flat set of (column, value) pairs used by the <ref refid="classapi_1_1v2_1_1Client" kindref="compound">Client</ref> SQL builders. Password hashing on the flat set is available to subclasses. <simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structapi_1_1v2_1_1Types_1_1CreateClient__t" kindref="compound">CreateClient_t</ref>, <ref refid="structapi_1_1v2_1_1Types_1_1UpdateClient__t" kindref="compound">UpdateClient_t</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
